{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6776 (vs 0.6315 for concat fusion in config_006). The higher accuracy and F1 (0.6464) suggest weighted fusion may improve multimodal performance compared to concat, though uncertainty remains about whether this reflects fusion strategy effectiveness or other uncontrolled factors. The result indicates potential value in weighted fusion but does not resolve whether multimodal approaches overall outperform RNA-only baselines."
}

